{"sourceUrl":"https://ccte.hhu.edu.cn/2026/0618/c16151a328240/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:49.308095+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ccte.hhu.edu.cn/2026/0618/c16151a328240/page.htm","html":"<div><div><p><br/></p></div><p><span><span><span><span>河海大学土木与交通学院</span></span></span></span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span><span><span>含精细爆破全国重点实验室</span></span></span></span><span><span>)</span></span></p><p><span><span> 2026</span></span><span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生校园开放日及有关安排的通知</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>河海大学土木与交通学院最早可追溯到</span></span></span><span><span>1922</span></span><span><span><span>年河海工程专门学校设立的“结构部”和“路工学部”，</span></span></span><span><span>2009</span></span><span><span><span>年组建土木与交通学院。学院土木工程学科为国家一级重点（培育）学科、江苏省一级重点学科、江苏省优势学科建设工程学科（</span></span></span><span><span>A</span></span><span><span><span>类），在第五轮学科评估位列</span></span></span><span><span>A</span></span><span><span><span>等，其中岩土工程为国家首批重点学科、结构工程为江苏省重点学科。交通运输工程学科在软科中国大学专业评级</span></span></span><span><span>B+</span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>学院致力于培养大土木大交通背景下的高级复合型人才。毕业生可到水利、市政、交通、能源或政府机关职能部门从事管理、科研、规划、审计等工作。近年来，河海土木院毕业生始终保持</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>97.5%</span></span><span><span><span><span>以上的高就业率，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>80%</span></span><span><span><span><span>以上毕业生前往行业重点单位就业，在行业内发挥重要作用，深受社会欢迎。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>为让更多优秀考生更深入地了解我单位特色与优势，各学科实力、师资力量、研究生教育情况和研究生招生信息等，我单位将于</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>12-13</span></span><span><span><span><span>日期间举办校园开放日活动。活动期间，我单位将进行研究生招生政策宣讲、与导师面对面交流互动等活动，提供详尽的报考信息和指导。欢迎有意向报考我单位研究生的同学前来参加，现将有关事项通知如下。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>一、活动规模及活动对象</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>本次活动规模拟定</span></span></span></span><span><span>180</span></span><span><span><span><span>名左右，具体专业详见报名系统，报名条件如下：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1.</span></span><span><span><span>具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2.</span></span><span><span><span>高水平大学或设有特色专业全日制高校的本科三年级在校生（</span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span>届毕业生）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 3.</span></span><span><span><span>有意来河海大学求学深造，对所报专业有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事相关学术研究或实践工作。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>二、报名时间及方式</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>请有意向申请我单位校园开放日的同学于北京时间</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>18</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>20:00—2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>23:00</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>在河海大学研究生招生管理系统（考生端）（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"http://yzss.hhu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yzss.hhu.edu.cn/</a></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）中，招生项目选择“全国优秀大学生校园开放日”进行注册、登录和信息填报（具体操作详见系统提示），不在规定时间内填报的所有报名信息均无效。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>三、材料提交与确认</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>参加我单位校园开放日的同学，需提供以下材料</span></span><span><span><strong>（</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>请按照顺序扫描成</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>PDF</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>文件，汇总生成一个压缩包，命名方式：报名专业</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>_</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>报名姓名</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>_</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>校园开放日报名材料</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>.ZIP</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>，上传至报名系统）</strong></span></span><span><span>，并携带纸质材料报到。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）“</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年全国优秀大学生校园开放日报名登记表”</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>份（请至报名系统生成和下载）。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>）身份证、学生证复印件。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span>）前两年半成绩单与总评成绩、排名证明</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>份。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span>）学术或科研成果、各类获奖证书扫描件各</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>份。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span>）国家英语四、六级考试成绩，或</span></span></span><span><span>IELTS/TOEFL</span></span><span><span><span>成绩，或</span></span></span><span><span>GRE/GMAT</span></span><span><span><span>成绩等体现自身外语水平的证明材料</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>份。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>我单位将对提交的报名信息进行审核后确定入围开放日活动对象。请提交报名申请的同学于北京时间</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日前查询审核状态，入围者请于北京时间</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>时前</span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span>在报名系统中点击确认参加，逾期未确认参加者视作放弃。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>四、活动方式及具体安排</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>开放日期间活动安排如下：</span></span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><strong>序号</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>时间</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>内容</strong></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><strong>地点</strong></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>7</span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span>12</span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>14</span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span>00-17</span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span>00</span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>开放日报到，</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>提交报名材料</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>科学馆</span></span></span><span>507</span><span><span><span>（本校学生）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>隽恒酒店大厅（外校学生）</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>2</span></p></td><td><p><span>7</span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span>13</span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>8</span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span>30-9</span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>开幕式</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>科学会堂</span></span></span><span>3</span><span><span><span>楼会议室</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>3</span></p></td><td><p><span>7</span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span>13</span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>9</span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span>40-10</span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span>40</span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>精细爆破全重、学院各研究所</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>专业、</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>导师介绍，校园文化特色介绍</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>见各专业（方向）具体安排</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>4</span></p></td><td><p><span>7</span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span>13</span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p><span>10</span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span>50-11</span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span>40</span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>专家学术讲座</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>见各专业（方向）具体安排</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>5</span></p></td><td><p><span>7</span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span>13</span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p><span>14</span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span>00-16</span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>教授名师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>面对面交流等</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>见各专业（方向）具体安排</span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span><span><strong>五、其他</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>其他未尽事宜请参见单位官网通知，最终招生</span></span><span><span>单位</span></span><span><span>、专业、方向和导师以</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年博士、硕士研究生招生简章和专业目录公布信息为准。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2.</span></span><span><span><span>开放日待遇</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span>）差旅、食宿：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span>提供校园开放日期间在南京的食宿（本校和南京本地学生住宿交通自理</span></span><span><span>，外地学生提供</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span><span><span>日晚上的住宿</span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>凡是参加我院校园开放日，后续推免或者一志愿被我校录取的外校应届考生，给予一定的往返交通补贴。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>）保险：单位将为参加校园开放日的同学购买开放日间人身意外伤害保险。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>联系方式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>土木与交通学院：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系人：</span></span></span><span><span><span>夏老师</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>025-83786634</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>hhutmyyz@163.com</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>通信地址：</span></span></span><span><span><span>南京市鼓楼区西康路</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>号河海大学土木与</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>交通学院</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>精细爆破全国重点实验室：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系人：董老师</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>025-83787159</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><a href=\"mailto:dongkai@hhu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>dongkai@hhu.edu.cn</span></a></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>通信地址：</span></span></span><span><span><span>南京市鼓楼区西康路</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span><span><span><span><span>号河海大学</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>科学馆</span></span></span><span>9</span><span><span><span>楼</span></span></span><span>921</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>                                    </span><span><span><span><span><span>土木与交通学院</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>                                  202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><div><p><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>第<span>4</span>页 共<span>4</span>页</span></span></span></p><br/><p><br/></p></div><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"5d2cd6b2b90118f0595ad34cf1f760936b996fae401a9516bf43d5c3c2e028ac","textLength":1869,"sourceSha256":"76cb5e2e2c12af742f3dfbbafd9b41e210e9758e637717